---
kind: lore
id: mid.route9
title: Route 9, the Orchard Road (Bloomfield to Silvercrest)
---

// Route 9 climbs from Bloomfield (east) through the Silvercrest orchards.
// Osric the bird keeper only flies his birds in the morning.

<beat id="arrive" on="enterRoute" target="route.r9" title="The Orchard Road" priority="10" once="run">
  ::bg{location="route-9" time="day"}
  ::music{action="change" mood="upbeat" volume="normal"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The road out of Bloomfield turns to gravel, then to grass, then to rows and rows of apple trees. At the top of the hill, the towers of Silvercrest catch the light.
  @narrator{code="0020"}: Somebody has carved a heart into every third tree. Somebody else has carved a Coinpaw next to every heart.
</beat>

<entry id="midR9Morning" on="enterRoute" target="route.r9" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Dew on the apples. A flock of Pidgelings lifts off the orchard wall all at once, and Osric's whistle calls them back.
</entry>

<entry id="midR9Day" on="enterRoute" target="route.r9" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The orchard hums with bees and picnickers. Somebody's radio is playing the Silvercrest station.
</entry>

<entry id="midR9Night" on="enterRoute" target="route.r9" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: At night the orchard is all rustling and eyes. Duskbats come out for the fallen apples.
</entry>

<entry id="midR9Sign" on="talk" target="npc.r9Signpost" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: ROUTE 9 — THE ORCHARD ROAD. Silvercrest ahead. Please do not feed the Coinpaws. They will expect it.
</entry>

// ── trainers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9HikerDorran" who="r9HikerDorran" intro="I walked here from Pebbleton! My legs are tired but my monsters aren't!" win="My legs AND my monsters are tired now." lose="Onward! To Silvercrest! After a sit-down." prize="480" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="midR9HikerDorranAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9HikerDorran" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9HikerDorran'])">
  @r9HikerDorran{code="0010"}: They say the Game Corner in Silvercrest has a basement. I say every building has a basement. It's called the ground floor, if you're a hiker.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9PicnickerLissy" who="r9PicnickerLissy" intro="You stepped on my blanket! That's a battle where I come from!" win="Fine. You can have a sandwich. Just one." lose="And stay off the blanket!" prize="320" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="midR9PicnickerLissyAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9PicnickerLissy" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9PicnickerLissy'])">
  @r9PicnickerLissy{code="0010"}: The cucumber ones are mine. The ones with apple are for my Sproutle. Don't tell her there's cucumber in hers too.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9CamperTobias" who="r9CamperTobias" intro="I've been camping here three days waiting for a real challenge!" win="Three days for that? I'm going home." lose="Day four, then." prize="360" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="midR9CamperTobiasAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9CamperTobias" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9CamperTobias'])">
  @r9CamperTobias{code="0010"}: I'm not really camping. My house is right there. But the tent makes it feel official.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9BugCatcherNils" who="r9BugCatcherNils" intro="I'm training for the Wildmoor contest! You're my practice bug!" win="I'm not a very good practice bug catcher." lose="Caught you! Well, beat you. Same thing." prize="240" instance="use-004"/>

<entry id="midR9BugCatcherNilsAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9BugCatcherNils" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9BugCatcherNils'])">
  @r9BugCatcherNils{code="0010"}: The contest is Tuesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays at the Wildmoor Preserve. Last time I caught a Cocoonix. It didn't do anything. Neither did the judges.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9LassPernille" who="r9LassPernille" intro="My monsters are cute AND strong. Pick a side and lose!" win="Just cute, then. That's still something." lose="Cute and strong. Told you." prize="400" instance="use-005"/>

<entry id="midR9LassPernilleAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9LassPernille" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9LassPernille'])">
  @r9LassPernille{code="0010"}: The department store in Silvercrest has a sale every weekend. I buy a ribbon for every monster. I have a lot of ribbons.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r9BirdKeeperOsric" when="@isMorning" who="r9BirdKeeperOsric" intro="My birds fly at sunrise and fight right after. You're just in time!" win="Back to the roost, everybody. You too, Galewing." lose="They're warmed up now, that's all." prize="440" instance="use-006"/>

<entry id="midR9BirdKeeperOsricAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r9BirdKeeperOsric" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r9BirdKeeperOsric']) && @isMorning">
  @r9BirdKeeperOsric{code="0010"}: Come back in the morning if you want to see them all go up at once. By noon they're asleep in the apple trees and won't come down for anybody.
</entry>
